  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "r20261107-a01",
      "title": "The First Fish",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "On Saturday morning, Bimo went fishing with his grandfather. They sat by the lake with two old fishing rods. Grandfather told Bimo to be quiet and patient.",
        "For one hour, nothing happened. Bimo wanted to go home, but his grandfather smiled and said, \"Fish can hear impatience.\" So Bimo stayed and watched the water.",
        "Suddenly, Bimo’s rod moved! He pulled hard and caught a small silver fish. It was his first fish ever. Bimo looked at it for a long moment, then put it back into the lake. \"Grow bigger,\" he whispered. \"I will catch you again next year.\""
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "fishing rods": "joran pancing",
        "lake": "danau",
        "patient": "sabar",
        "impatience": "ketidaksabaran",
        "suddenly": "tiba-tiba",
        "pulled": "menarik",
